    "en": {
      "title": "Wire saws",
      "h1": "Wire saws",
      "description": "Marini offers a wide range of wire saws for different types of quarry and rock work.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Marini logo",
          "href": "/produkter/marini",
          "width": 637,
          "height": 86,
          "src": "/assets/img/logo-marini.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Wire saws: image 2",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1369,
          "src": "/assets/img/marini-vajersagar-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Marini offers a wide range of wire saws for different types of quarry and rock work."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "For granite and harder stones, Marini offers machines with variable wire speed controlled by an inverter. These machines are adapted to handle tougher stone materials and are used for both vertical and horizontal cuts. The machines can be easily positioned and have high precision thanks to electronic control of the wire speed. Machines with variable wire speed are designated GRAN in the model name."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "For marble and similar softer stones in quarries, wire saws with fixed wire speed are used, such as saws designated MAR in the name, for example: MAR FIL SUPER SP, which has motors of 75 or 100 horsepower. These machines are ideal for precise cuts with even wire tension, and they can work on sloping surfaces and horizontal cuts near ground level."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Granite: variable wire speed",
          "gen": true
        },
